# L §2.5 Keys: a bare key compared with a key takes its index; 13 is no key of ages = int 1..12: LOAD-KEY.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

index ages = int 1..12

def a[k in ages]: int at reader
  rule base = 0
  rule young beats base = 1 when k == 13

ask q: a[10] law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-KEY 13 is not a key of ages ...
